						               													<description>You're never too young to have a senior moment or to play Senior Moments, a memory game for anyone who might need the practice.

Senior Moments Travel Edition is a compact, quick-play memory challenge card game themed around classic &amp;ldquo;senior moment&amp;rdquo; jokes&amp;mdash;with a friendly, pop culture twist. The oldest player starts as the active player. The person to their right is the reader and draws from the deck. If a Special Card appears, the reader keeps it to use later and draws again until a Memory Card is pulled. The reader then reads the Memory Card twice, slowly and clearly. The active player must repeat the list of items&amp;mdash;or perform the listed actions and will score 1 point for each item remembered or action performed correctly.

Play continues clockwise until someone reaches the agreed point goal. After the first player hits the goal, everyone else gets one final turn to try to match or beat it. If there&amp;rsquo;s a tie, those players go head-to-head, taking turns reading lists to each other until one misses&amp;mdash;last one standing wins.

&amp;mdash;description from the publisher

</description>
